  "Id": 1124,
  "Title": "AKU Conference on \"Health Care: Keeping Pace with New Challenges\"",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "A two-day Postgraduate Medical Education (PGME) Conference will be held at the Aga Khan University (AKU) on Friday and Saturday, May 19 and 20, 2000. The theme of the conference is \"Healthcare: Keeping Pace with New Challenges.\"",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass388845BFA5BF4B92B7ED9EFC1AF7025C\"><div>A two-day Postgraduate Medical Education (PGME) Conference will be held at the Aga Khan University (AKU) on Friday and Saturday, May 19 and 20, 2000. The theme of the conference is &quot;Healthcare&#58; Keeping Pace with New Challenges.&quot;</div><div><br></div><div>A panel of national and international experts will address topical issues such as the new challenges being faced by trainees and educators alike in the area of postgraduate training of young physicians. Specific sessions will be devoted to the relevance of bioethics to medical practice, and the need and importance of medical research in Pakistan. Workshops on consultation skills and data analysis will also be arranged for a select number of trainees.</div></div>",
